  "question": {
    "text": "Match list I with list II and select this correct answer using the codes given below the lists.\r<table border=\"1px solid\">\r\t<thead>\r\t\t<tr>\r\t\t\t<th>&nbsp;</th>\r\t\t\t<th><br />\r\t\t\tList I (Type of glass)</th>\r\t\t\t<th>&nbsp;</th>\r\t\t\t<th><br />\r\t\t\tList II (Property/use)</th>\r\t\t</tr>\r\t</thead>\r\t<tbody>\r\t\t<tr>\r\t\t\t<td><br />\r\t\t\t<math><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>)</mo></math></td>\r\t\t\t<td><br />\r\t\t\tBorosilicate glass</td>\r\t\t\t<td><br />\r\t\t\t<math><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo></math></td>\r\t\t\t<td><br />\r\t\t\tVery high transparency</td>\r\t\t</tr>\r\t\t<tr>\r\t\t\t<td><br />\r\t\t\t<math><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>)</mo></math></td>\r\t\t\t<td><br />\r\t\t\tCalcium-alkali silicate glass</td>\r\t\t\t<td><br />\r\t\t\t<math><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo></math></td>\r\t\t\t<td><br />\r\t\t\tCheap laboratory glass wares</td>\r\t\t</tr>\r\t\t<tr>\r\t\t\t<td><br />\r\t\t\t<math><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>)</mo></math></td>\r\t\t\t<td><br />\r\t\t\tLead glass</td>\r\t\t\t<td><br />\r\t\t\t<math><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo></math></td>\r\t\t\t<td><br />\r\t\t\tOptical glass</td>\r\t\t</tr>\r\t\t<tr>\r\t\t\t<td><br />\r\t\t\t<math><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo></math></td>\r\t\t\t<td><br />\r\t\t\tSoda glass</td>\r\t\t\t<td><br />\r\t\t\t<math><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo></math></td>\r\t\t\t<td><br />\r\t\t\tDomestic glass for windows</td>\r\t\t</tr>\r\t\t<tr>\r\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\t\t\t<td><br />\r\t\t\t<math><mn>5</mn><mo>.</mo></math></td>\r\t\t\t<td><br />\r\t\t\tLow coefficient of expansion</td>\r\t\t</tr>\r\t</tbody>\r</table>\r",
